{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the northern border!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a new recruit in the Bloodmoon Order, you\u2019ve been given the honourable duty of conducting the night patrol at the northernmost outpost far way from civilized society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locals tell stories of a witch who has ruled these lands for centuries. The Bloodmoon Order\u2019s presence will not go unnoticed \u2014 by setting foot in her domain, they have stirred an ancient fury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witch does not share her forest </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Each night, evil will attempt to set its roots in these woods.  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s your job to patrol the forest and cleanse any locations tainted by its influence. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083510/extras/12429bee2eb6221b4dcc6ac0cfb092a5.avif?t=1762253075\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u201cThe blood of the moon shall purify thee of evil.\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A location corrupted by the witch\u2019s presence must be purified.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083510/extras/208b430eb4d0127b8f117ce82f8024a7.avif?t=1762253075\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >They say the forest belongs to her\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your every step, you're not alone in these woods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083510/extras/56575db7812cb45c3f9517ba8b559fa2.poster.avif?t=1762253075\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets